      "path": "app/src/main/java/tv/own/owntv/kevbox/sports/FootballListings.kt",
      "content": "`LISTED_SPORTS[it.sport]` matches the exact text, so a row tagged `\"Basketball\"` or `\"mma \"` maps to nothing and drops out of `link()` without any error. Since the server's word is deliberately kept as free text, trim and lowercase it when parsing so a small difference in how the server writes it doesn't hide every listing for that sport.",
